  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（税効果会計関係）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;１．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 576.00000000000000000000000001px; margin-left: auto"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
